### Test All New Workflow Management Endpoints
### This file tests all three new endpoints

### 1. Create Workflow
POST {{host}}/api/workflows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "typeCode": "ReceiveGoods",
  "name": "Приемка по накладной",
  "description": "Приемка по каждой строчки накладной",
  "data": {
    "invoiceId": "INV-2024-001",
    "counterparty": "ООО Поставщик",
    "contract": "Договор №123"
  }
}

### 2. Get Created Workflow (use code from response above)
GET {{host}}/api/workflows/{{workflowCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Cancel Workflow
POST {{host}}/api/workflows/{{workflowCode}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Complete Workflow (create new one first, then complete)
POST {{host}}/api/workflows/{{workflowCode}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
